  "hash": 262821312,
  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "While Airborne with at least one full Melee Charge, pressing [Air Move] activates <strand/>Weavewalk and consumes 20% Melee Ability Energy.\n\nWhile <strand/>Weavewalk is active, your Melee Energy drains at a rate of 25% per second, and you generate a Perched <strand/>Threadling every 0.5 seconds.\n\n<strand/>Weavewalk grants 90% Damage Resistance against Combatants and Players, and functionally grants the effects of <void/>Void Invisibility, preventing enemy combatants from engaging you.\n\nYou are unable to interact with the world while <strand/>Weavewalk is active. This includes reviving other Players, collecting ammo bricks, or picking up Orbs of Power. <strand/>Threadlings, <arc/>Arc Souls, and <exotic No Time To Explain's 'Time-Slip Portal' /> deal 50% decreased damage while <strand/>Weavewalk is active. \n\nExiting <strand/>Weavewalk grants <strand/>Woven Mail based on the duration it was active, granting 2 to 20 seconds of <strand/>Woven Mail.",
      "updatedAt": "2026-05-22T22:05:51.126Z",
      "updatedBy": "Hawkmoona"
    }
  },
  "associated": [],
